  "description": "Cheon Yu-Hyeon is so close to inheriting the family business when his ailing father presents one condition: he needs to give his father a grandchild. It shouldn’t be too hard for an omega like Yu-Hyeon, as long as he can find himself a suitable alpha that isn’t his childhood friend and company rival Lee Hyeon-Do. But Hyeon-Do has been suffering a decade-long crush on Yu-Hyeon and desperately wants to be his baby daddy. And Yu-Hyeon is finding it harder to resist his friend’s flirty tactics to get him in bed...\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
